          <Pad Id="37KeCeu9WHuFd9JZHg1zCk" Bounds="85,85,640,103" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="QtTexture [Qt] over a 3D scene:&#xD;&#xA;- half-transparent Rectangles (Color alpha 0.5) and a Text, Clear Color transparent&#xD;&#xA;- Output is premultiplied alpha: Blend State AlphaBlendPremultiplied&#xD;&#xA;- Format: B8G8R8A8_UNorm_SRgb (default), the UNorm formats or R16G16B16A16_Float&#xD;&#xA;- Renderer [Qt]: the same scene in a Qt window, to compare the colors">
