          <Pad Id="CkRzmIcQuV0LWGvTWW5HlC" Bounds="85,905,840,218" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="Notes:&#xD;&#xA;- QtTexture outputs premultiplied alpha. AlphaBlend expects straight alpha: it multiplies RGB by alpha a second time and makes half-transparent parts too dark. Where straight alpha is needed, unpremultiply the texture first (RGB divided by alpha).&#xD;&#xA;- Opaque colors look the same in both windows. Half-transparent ones differ: Stride blends in linear color space, a Qt window in gamma space.&#xD;&#xA;- Windows only (Direct3D 11). QtTexture is Experimental: pins and behavior may still change.">
            <p:TypeAnnotation LastCategoryFullName="Primitive" LastDependency="VL.CoreLib.vl">
              <Choice Kind="TypeFlag" Name="String" />
            </p:TypeAnnotation>
            <p:ValueBoxSettings>
              <p:fontsize p:Type="Int32">9</p:fontsize>
              <p:stringtype p:Assembly="VL.Core" p:Type="VL.Core.StringType">Comment</p:stringtype>
            </p:ValueBoxSettings>
          </Pad>
